    },
    "formula": "optY = ((top + 108) / 2 + centroidY) / 2 - 50, where top is geom().top[1], centroidY is the half-width-weighted mean y of the body between top and the floor (rows every 0.5 unit), and 50 is the viewBox centre. Props never count. optPx(size) = -round2(optY x size / 136): a negative number, the px to move the character up so the body's optical centre sits on the row's centre line. glyph() writes it as --oy on its <svg>; inline places apply translate: 0 var(--oy)."
  },
